'''Blossom''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Blossom Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Sakura Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
It takes the shape of a tactical revolver but with a Valentine's Day theme. It has a pink barrel that connects to the pink frame and cylinder. Surrounding the barrel is a golden outline, which also wraps around the golden trigger. Beneath the barrel is a white slide, and connected to the outline on top of the barrel is the golden front sight. Blossoming on the side of the cylinder are three sakura blossoms, hence the name. The handle is white with pink laces wrapped around it, connected by golden pearls. Below the handle is a golden plate, and behind the frame is the golden curved hammer. 

== Trivia ==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Sakura]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sakura Set|Sakura Set]].
*This and its partner knife are the fourth Gamepass weapons where the player had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].
*It is the first Valentine’s Day themed [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

